<title>USA: Variflex sees profit in current year.</title>
<headline>Variflex sees profit in current year.</headline>
<dateline>MOORPARK, Calif 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jay Losi, President and Chief Operating Officer of Variflex, said the company continues to believe the curent year will be profitable.</p>
<p>&quot;Overall, sales during the month (November) were relatively strong and were considerably higher than a year ago,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>&quot;Consequently, while we cannot make a firm projection, we expect sales to be higher in the current quarter.&quot;</p>
</text>
